SUMMARY:Door 8: Risk lives in the boardroom
DESCRIPTION:DO: Name an accountable owner for cyber and AI risk\, and rehea
 rse a crisis with the board every year.\nDON’T: File security under IT
 ’s budget - NIS2 makes management bodies approve and oversee risk measur
 es.\n\nLesson learnt (Jaguar Land Rover\, Sep 2025): A cyber attack halted
  production for about five weeks. The Cyber Monitoring Centre estimated th
 e cost to the UK economy at £1.9 billion.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware
 -by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=8\n\nAI-assisted · an initiat
 ive of ENISA’s ARCH AHWG
