SUMMARY:Door 30: Speak up\, fast
DESCRIPTION:DO: Report a wrong click\, a lost device or a regretted paste i
 nto a chatbot straight away - minutes matter.\nDON’T: Hide a mistake out
  of embarrassment. Under NIS2\, significant incidents need an early warnin
 g within 24 hours.\n\nLesson learnt (Co-op\, Apr 2025): Co-op spotted intr
 uders and shut systems down early. Members’ data was still stolen\, but 
 by the attackers’ own account the fast shutdown stopped ransomware being
  deployed.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdve
 nt2026/?day=30\n\nAI-assisted · an initiative of ENISA’s ARCH AHWG
