SUMMARY:Door 31: Three resolutions
DESCRIPTION:DO: Carry three habits into 2027: passkeys on\, verify before y
 ou pay\, think before you paste.\nDON’T: Treat security as a season - bo
 ok a January check-in and keep the habit going.\n\nLesson learnt (This cal
 endar\, 2023–2025): Change Healthcare\, 23andMe\, Arup\, M&S: in each\, 
 the way in was a missing basic - MFA\, a unique password\, a call-back\, a
  verification step.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.github.io/Cy
 berAIAdvent2026/?day=31\n\nAI-assisted · an initiative of ENISA’s ARCH 
 AHWG
